---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import portrait from '../assets/tanzil.jpg';
import { experience, milestones } from '../lib/content';
const roles = await experience();
const recognition = await milestones();
---
<Layout title="About" description="The person behind the projects: Tanzil Ahmed on software, curiosity, debate, teaching and community.">
  <div class="container page-body"><header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">The person behind the pixels</p><h1>Curiosity brought<br/>me <span class="serif-word">here.</span></h1></header>
    <section class="about-intro"><figure class="about-photo"><Image src={portrait} alt="Tanzil Ahmed relaxing in a blue armchair by a window." widths={[480, 800, 1280]} sizes="(max-width: 799px) 90vw, 40vw" format="webp" loading="eager"/><figcaption>Tanzil Ahmed · Outside the editor.</figcaption></figure><div class="about-copy"><h2>Hello, I’m Tanzil.</h2><p>I’m a developer and builder drawn to the point where a useful idea becomes something people can actually use.</p><p>That has taken me from websites and debate tools to Bangla-first products, learning experiences and small assistants for everyday work. I like understanding the activity behind a tool as much as the technology underneath it.</p><p>I learned by exploring, building, getting stuck, and trying again. Writing and teaching became a way to leave something useful for the next person following a similar path.</p><p>Outside software, debate and theatre have taught me to listen, question assumptions and see a situation from another perspective. Those habits come back into the way I build.</p><a class="text-link" href="/beyond/">There’s more beyond code<Icon name="diagonal" size={17}/></a></div></section>
    <section class="section experience-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">A few places I’ve contributed</p><h2>Work &<br/><span class="serif-word">experience.</span></h2></div><div class="experience-list">{roles.map((role) => <article><p class="eyebrow">{role.data.role}</p><h3>{role.data.title}</h3><p>{role.data.summary}</p></article>)}</div></section>
    <section class="section"><div class="section-top"><div><p class="eyebrow">Moments along the way</p><h2>Milestones, not<br/><span class="serif-word">the whole story.</span></h2></div></div><div class="recognition-list">{recognition.map((item) => <article><span class="mono">{item.data.year}</span><div><p class="eyebrow">{item.data.kind}</p><h3>{item.data.title}</h3><p>{item.data.summary}</p>{item.data.url && <a class="text-link" href={item.data.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore the work<Icon name="diagonal" size={16}/></a>}</div></article>)}</div></section>
  </div>
</Layout>
